§§ The folders in the Contents list.  A folder is a tag.
{{{
*vision - the ideas lhde rests on
*component - one note per part of the system
*plan - undertakings with a design behind them
*status - how work is tracked
**next - agreed as the next things
**inprogress - being built now
**decided - choices made, so they are not reopened by accident
**done - finished; kept for the links
*bug - something concrete and wrong
*idea - a wish, not yet a plan
*meta - about this wiki
}}}
